{"comparisons":[],"failures":[],"frontier":[],"initial":{"alternatives":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Sets operative SFC circular scope, instruments, exemption period and start date.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"reason":"Explains original effective date, regulatory-arbitrage rationale and alignment context.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"reason":"Describes EU background exemption and reporting conditions; not the SFC operative rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"reason":"Describes UK background exemption and its indefinite duration; not the SFC operative rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"},{"reason":"States that the Hong Kong Code provision will be amended and gazetted later, creating timing uncertainty.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"reason":"Contact instruction; no substantive applicability rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u7.1479"},{"reason":"Identifies issuing division; no substantive applicability rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u10.1587"},{"reason":"Identifies issuing authority; no substantive applicability rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u12.1614"},{"reason":"Document terminator; no substantive applicability rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u13.1649"},{"reason":"Circular identifier; no substantive applicability rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u14.1654"},{"reason":"Defines the referenced SFC margin requirements as Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"},{"reason":"EU legal citation; supports explanatory background only.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u17.1837"},{"reason":"UK policy-statement citation; supports explanatory background only.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u19.1919"},{"reason":"Explains what BTS 2016/2251 refers to; supports UK background only.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The operative text addresses licensed corporations and the listed non-centrally cleared equity options. It does not expressly state whether every licensed corporation counterparty, transaction capacity, or geographic booking location is included.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"The circular defines the collective term “non-centrally cleared equity options” by listing single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options. It does not define “licensed corporation” beyond the Code reference.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The exemption is stated for the listed instruments, but no additional conditions (such as reporting, monitoring, counterparty class or trade purpose) are stated in the SFC operative text. EU monitoring/reporting is described as foreign background and could be mistakenly treated as an SFC condition.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u3.801"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"“Will exempt” announces an SFC decision, while the Code paragraph “will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course” leaves the legal mechanism and interim force unresolved.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The announced period begins 4 January 2026 and lasts “until further notice”; the amendment is to be gazetted later, so the relationship between announcement date, commencement date and gazettal is unresolved.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Applicability depends on instrument classification, absence of central clearing, licensed-corporation status, the Part III Schedule 10 requirement, and whether the circular operates before gazettal. EU and UK materials explain alignment but do not themselves determine SFC scope.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801","d802c45a4262c.u4.1019","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"PROPOSED"}],"questions":["Does the announced exemption have operative effect from 4 January 2026 before the Part III Schedule 10 amendment is gazetted?","Does “licensed corporations” cover all transactions of a licensed corporation, including offshore booking or counterparties outside the SFC perimeter?","Are any EU-style monitoring or reporting conditions intended to apply in Hong Kong, or are they explanatory background only?","What precise contractual or product features determine that an option is a single-stock, equity-basket or equity-index option and is non-centrally cleared?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control concerns whether an SFC licensed corporation may treat a specified option exposure as exempt from the SFC margin requirement on a stated date.","The option is classified as one of the three listed types and is not centrally cleared.","No EU or UK condition is imported unless the SFC text expressly adopts it."],"citations":[{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"}],"distinction":"Reading A treats the circular as an operative announcement: from 2026-01-04, the listed non-centrally cleared equity options are exempt for licensed corporations, despite the later gazettal statement. The foreign EU and UK provisions are alignment context only.","family":"modality","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is a corporation licensed by or registered with the SFC under the Code of Conduct context.","name":"licensed_corporation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The transaction is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity-basket or equity-index option.","name":"qualifying_non_cleared_equity_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessment date is on or after 2026-01-04.","name":"assessment_on_or_after_2026_01_04","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The announced exemption remains in force because no further notice ending it has been identified.","name":"exemption_until_further_notice","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"}],"result":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The selected exemption condition is satisfied when the actor is a licensed corporation, the option qualifies, the assessment date is on or after 2026-01-04, and the exemption remains in force. False means at least one of those conditions is not established; it does not determine whether the underlying Code amendment has been gazetted.","result_type":"bool","scope":"A selected SFC margin-exemption control for one licensed corporation and one option exposure."},"local_id":"reading_a","questions":["Whether the circular alone is legally sufficient before gazettal remains unresolved."],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Under the announced-operational reading, the selected SFC exemption condition is satisfied for a licensed corporation's qualifying non-centrally cleared equity option assessed on or after 2026-01-04 while the exemption remains in force.","subject":"SFC margin-exemption applicability"},{"assumptions":["The Code amendment and gazettal are prerequisites for operative legal exemption.","The announcement signals intended future alignment but does not itself disapply the existing Part III requirement before gazettal."],"citations":[{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"The margin requirements for non-centrally cleared equity options were originally scheduled to take effect on that date.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"}],"distinction":"Reading B treats the circular as a prospective policy announcement whose operative effect depends on the promised Code amendment and gazettal. Before that event, the existing margin requirement remains applicable; after gazettal, the listed options are exempt from 2026-01-04 or the gazettal commencement date, whichever the amendment specifies.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_b","questions":["The text does not state whether gazettal is constitutive, merely formal, or retroactive to 2026-01-04.","The text does not specify the commencement date in the eventual amendment."],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Under the gazettal-dependent reading, the exemption condition is satisfied only once the required Code amendment has been gazetted and its commencement requirements are met; the circular alone does not establish that condition before then.","subject":"SFC margin-exemption applicability"}]},"controlled-language":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Operative announcement supplies the addressees, product classes, commencement date and until-further-notice limitation.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"reason":"Confirms the displaced commencement date and explains alignment; insignificant exposures are stated as rationale, without an individual eligibility threshold.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"reason":"EU background; its permanence, monitoring and reporting qualification are not expressly incorporated into the SFC exemption.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"reason":"UK background; the publication date and indefinite exemption do not establish SFC commencement or conditions.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"},{"reason":"Identifies a pending Code amendment and gazettal, without expressly making either a condition precedent.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"reason":"Administrative contact instruction, not an exemption eligibility condition.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u7.1479"},{"reason":"Issuing division identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u10.1587"},{"reason":"Issuing regulator identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u12.1614"},{"reason":"Document end marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u13.1649"},{"reason":"Document reference identifier; does not supply an operative date.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u14.1654"},{"reason":"Identifies the underlying margin requirements; their substantive scope is not reproduced.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"},{"reason":"Citation to EU background authority; linked text is not supplied.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u17.1837"},{"reason":"Citation to UK background authority; linked text is not supplied.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u19.1919"},{"reason":"Explains the UK technical standards reference, without extending its definitions to the SFC control.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The proposed control concerns a licensed corporation and margin requirements identified in Part III of Schedule 10. The broader title of the Code does not independently extend this announcement to registered persons.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"The collective term covers non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket and equity index options. Technical classification boundaries and the underlying Code scope remain unavailable.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The exemption attaches to the identified SFC margin requirements for the listed products. EU monitoring and reporting qualify the EU account; insignificant exposures explain the SFC decision without creating a stated firm-level threshold.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"The announcement proposes relief from margin requirements, not a prohibition on exchanging margin, a licensing trigger or a finding of compliance. The future Code amendment is separately announced.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The announced SFC period starts inclusively on 4 January 2026 and continues until further notice. EU and UK dates are background. Subsequent notice status cannot be established from this packet.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801","d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"The underlying Code, forthcoming amendment and any subsequent notice are needed to resolve legal implementation and detailed scope. Three dependencies are listed as missing without enough information to map each to a particular instrument.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u6.1357","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671","d802c45a4262c.u17.1837","d802c45a4262c.u19.1919","d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What does Part III of Schedule 10, particularly paragraph 7(e), provide about the relevant corporations, transactions and margin obligations?","Has any subsequent SFC notice changed this exemption, and with what effective date and transitional treatment?","Does the amendment or gazettal establish any legal commencement condition absent from the circular?","Which instruments correspond to the three missing dependency identifiers?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control tests applicability of the announced exemption to one corporation, one option transaction and one assessment date.","The explicit commencement date governs the announcement; the promised amendment and gazettal are not treated as unstated conditions precedent.","Product and actor classifications are supplied facts requiring appropriate assessment, not inferred from a product label or the Code's title.","Whether a later notice affects this transaction on the assessment date remains unknown unless supported by further evidence."],"citations":[{"quote":"inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"from 4 January 2026 until further notice","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"licensed corporations’ exposures to non-centrally cleared equity options are currently insignificant","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"quote":"subject to monitoring and periodic reporting2.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"quote":"It implemented an indefinite exemption from the UK bilateral margining requirements for single-stock equity options and index options.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"},{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"}],"distinction":"This reading gives the expressly announced date independent effect while retaining the future-notice limitation. It does not import EU reporting conditions, UK permanence or an exposure threshold. A gazettal-dependent alternative would materially postpone eligibility, but the supplied text does not sufficiently support formalizing that alternative. The strongest uncertainty is the legal implementation and detailed scope supplied by the missing Code and later instruments.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed corporation is a licensed corporation addressed by the SFC circular.","name":"is_licensed_corporation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed margin obligation for this corporation and transaction would fall within Part III of Schedule 10 absent this announced exemption, taking other applicable scope conditions into account.","name":"otherwise_within_margin_requirements","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed option transaction is not centrally cleared.","name":"is_non_centrally_cleared","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed instrument is a single-stock option, equity basket option or equity index option within the circular's listed categories.","name":"is_listed_equity_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The date for which applicability of the announced exemption is assessed.","name":"assessment_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"On the assessment date, no subsequent SFC notice has become effective that ends or displaces the announced exemption for this assessed transaction. Absence of such a notice from this packet does not establish this fact.","name":"announcement_remains_applicable","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and is_non_centrally_cleared is_listed_equity_option (>= assessment_date (date 2026-01-04)) announcement_remains_applicable)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_corporation otherwise_within_margin_requirements)"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["Do the underlying Code or implementing instruments narrow any listed product category or actor classification?","How does any later notice apply to existing transactions, new transactions and accrued margin obligations?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For a licensed corporation and an otherwise applicable margin obligation within Part III of Schedule 10, true means the assessed transaction satisfies the proposed conditions for the announced SFC exemption: it is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, the assessment date is on or after 4 January 2026, and the announcement remains applicable on that date. False means at least one of those conditions fails; it does not establish that margin is owed under every other rule. Outside the stated scope this control supplies no applicability decision, and unknown facts remain unknown.","subject":"Applicability of the announced SFC equity-option margin exemption"}]},"normative":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Operative actor, product, margin and temporal scope interpreted.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"reason":"Original commencement and alignment rationale inform timing; insignificant exposures are explanatory, not an express eligibility threshold.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"reason":"EU exemption, commencement and monitoring conditions are overseas background, not expressly incorporated SFC conditions.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"reason":"UK publication date and indefinite exemption are overseas background; neither supplies the SFC commencement or duration.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"},{"reason":"Identifies a pending amendment and gazettal; their relationship to legal implementation remains unresolved.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"reason":"Administrative contact invitation supplies no exemption condition.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u7.1479"},{"reason":"Issuing division identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u10.1587"},{"reason":"Issuer identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u12.1614"},{"reason":"Document closing marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u13.1649"},{"reason":"Document reference identifier; does not establish an issuance date.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u14.1654"},{"reason":"Identifies the margin regime referenced by the exemption; underlying provisions were not supplied.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"},{"reason":"EU citation identifies explanatory authority; referenced text was not supplied or inspected.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u17.1837"},{"reason":"UK policy citation identifies explanatory authority; referenced text was not supplied or inspected.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u19.1919"},{"reason":"Explains the UK standards reference, without defining or enlarging SFC operative scope.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The announcement addresses licensed corporations and specified non-centrally cleared equity options. The broader title of the referenced Code does not establish an extension to registered persons. Underlying actor and transaction classifications require the missing Code provisions.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"The collective label covers single-stock, equity basket and equity index options that are non-centrally cleared. Detailed product classification and the underlying margin requirements are not reproduced.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The exemption attaches to SFC margin requirements for the listed products. EU monitoring and reporting conditions attach expressly to the EU exemption. Insignificant exposures explain SFC policy without supplying an individual exposure test.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"The SFC announces an exemption and a future Code amendment. This supports an exemption-applicability predicate, not a determination of overall compliance, permission to conduct business or licence possession.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The announced SFC start date is 2026-01-04, inclusive, with duration limited by further notice. It is not the EU's permanent exemption or the UK's indefinite exemption. No SFC termination date, later notice or gazettal date is supplied.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801","d802c45a4262c.u4.1019","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Part III of Schedule 10 and paragraph 7(e) are material unprovided dependencies. The packet also lists three unresolved dependency identifiers without mapping them to provisions. Whether amendment or gazettal affects legal implementation cannot be settled here; the announcement does not expressly make either a commencement condition.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u6.1357","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671","d802c45a4262c.u17.1837","d802c45a4262c.u19.1919","d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What actor, transaction and margin classifications does Part III of Schedule 10 impose, including paragraph 7(e)?","Does the applicable legal mechanism give effect to the announced exemption on 2026-01-04 independently of the subsequent amendment and gazettal?","Has any further SFC notice changed or ended this exemption for the selected actor, transaction, margin requirement and assessment date?","Which referenced materials correspond to missing.60583204ae3dc30d17bad37f, missing.3fa08e37cc9ca8964c94abb9 and missing.4dd72c04a8ea00444bb6b1a9?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["This reading models the announced exemption's applicability, conditional on classification under the referenced margin regime; it does not determine the circular's independent legal force.","The stated commencement date is inclusive. Amendment and gazettal are treated as pending implementation steps because the supplied text does not expressly condition commencement on them.","Overseas monitoring, reporting and duration provisions are explanatory background rather than incorporated SFC requirements.","The absence of a supplied later notice does not establish that no relevant later notice exists."],"citations":[{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock opti