ventual amendment."],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Under the gazettal-dependent reading, the exemption condition is satisfied only once the required Code amendment has been gazetted and its commencement requirements are met; the circular alone does not establish that condition before then.","subject":"SFC margin-exemption applicability"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.362f5626ec7d4ad1bac35f32","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.3921e737e8c54ced96ce3bef9ea48b95","commitment":"8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015ea4624c2c3f485506f0edead35e063bd5ce0dfd2","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_SCHEMA","details":"Invalid expression atom"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015","order":4,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The result addresses only the circular's announced Hong Kong exemption and does not determine any separate EU or UK legal requirement.","A transaction satisfying all listed factual conditions is treated as within the announced exemption; the result does not confer licensing, regulatory approval or legal compliance generally.","The assessed transaction is undertaken by a corporation that is licensed by the SFC and therefore within the circular's addressed population.","“Non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options” is treated as the operative product category; overseas EU and UK materials are explanatory background rather than independent Hong Kong applicability conditions.","The announced exemption is treated as operative from 2026-01-04 even though the Code amendment is stated to be gazetted later.","“Until further notice” is treated as continuing unless a later SFC notice or effective amendment withdraws or changes it."],"citations":[{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"1 As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"}],"distinction":"The factual condition for the Hong Kong exemption combines actor status (licensed corporation), product classification (single-stock, equity basket or equity index option), clearing status (non-centrally cleared), and time (from 2026-01-04 until further notice). EU and UK exemptions explain alignment but are not predicates in this model.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed corporation is licensed by or registered with the SFC and is a licensed corporation addressed by the circular.","name":"corporation_is_sfc_licensed","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The transaction is a single-stock option, an equity basket option, or an equity index option.","name":"option_is_covered_equity_type","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The transaction is not cleared through a central counterparty.","name":"option_is_non_centrally_cleared","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"},{"meaning":"The transaction date is the Gregorian date on which the option transaction is assessed.","name":"transaction_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"The announced exemption start date is 2026-01-04.","name":"exemption_start_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"The announced exemption remains in force at the assessment date because no later notice has withdrawn or altered it.","name":"exemption_remains_until_further_notice","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"boolean"}],"result":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] (and corporation_is_sfc_licensed option_is_covered_equity_type option_is_non_centrally_cleared (>= transaction_date exemption_start_date) exemption_remains_until_further_notice)","result_type":"bool","scope":"Whether the assessed transaction falls within the SFC-announced exemption from the specified margin requirements on the assessed date; true means the condition for announced exemption coverage is satisfied, false means at least one stated condition is not satisfied or the exemption is no longer in force."},"local_id":"sfc_equity_option_exemption_scope","questions":["Has the assessed corporation's SFC licensing status been verified for the transaction date?","What is the transaction's exact option type, clearing arrangement and date?","Has any SFC notice or effective Code amendment changed the exemption since 2026-01-04?","Whether the assessed corporation is licensed by the SFC at the relevant time.","The transaction's precise option category and whether it is centrally cleared.","The transaction date and whether it is on or after 2026-01-04.","Whether a later SFC notice or gazetted Code amendment has changed or terminated the announced exemption."],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The assessed transaction satisfies the factual conditions for coverage by the SFC's announced margin exemption if it is entered into by an SFC-licensed corporation, is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, occurs on or after 2026-01-04, and the exemption remains in force until further notice.","subject":"Applicability of the SFC-announced margin exemption to a specified Hong Kong equity-options transaction"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"9997122190a6949bbe6ad0472f1b0d2c420388c391ea4bfd9efc0e370a84dde0","candidate_id":"candidate.d6f2f29abb95417cb0c0f86b2baae228","commitment":"298564cf01d1366a4a8e2db50c5403df249a1d32b3e118d645738d66de931695","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.298564cf01d1366a4a8e2db5","order":5,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one option contract and one identified SFC margin requirement for one corporation on one assessment date.","Licensed-corporation status, product classification and clearing status must be established separately.","The announced start date operates without an additional condition that the prospective Code amendment has already been gazetted.","EU and UK durations, reporting conditions and product lists are explanatory background and are not incorporated as SFC conditions.","Any subsequent notice must be assessed for its effective date and effect on this particular exemption; publication alone does not necessarily terminate it."],"citations":[{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"1 As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"},{"quote":"In the EU, a permanent exemption from the requirement to exchange margin for single-stock equity options and equity index options became effective on 24 December 2024, subject to monitoring and periodic reporting2.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"quote":"It implemented an indefinite exemption from the UK bilateral margining requirements for single-stock equity options and index options.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"}],"distinction":"Product category, clearing status, regulated actor, requirement provenance and temporal continuation are separate predicates. An equity basket option is expressly included in the SFC announcement even though the overseas summaries omit that category. The SFC exemption is subject to further notice; neither the EU's permanent duration nor its monitoring and reporting conditions determine SFC eligibility. Pending gazettal is a separate legislative event, not an expressed commencement condition.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed corporation holds licensed-corporation status on the assessment date.","name":"licensed_corporation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the assessed corporation and date"},{"meaning":"The identified margin requirement belongs to the SFC requirements set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct.","name":"schedule_10_margin_requirement","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the identified requirement"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is not centrally cleared on the assessment date.","name":"non_centrally_cleared","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the assessed contract and date"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is classified as a single-stock option.","name":"single_stock_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the assessed contract"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is classified as an equity basket option.","name":"equity_basket_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the assessed contract"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is classified as an equity index option.","name":"equity_index_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the assessed contract"},{"meaning":"The date for which the announced exemption's applicability is assessed, rather than an assumed trade-execution or contract-inception date.","name":"assessment_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"A subsequent SFC notice has taken effect by the assessment date and withdraws, replaces or limits the announced exemption so that this contract, corporation and requirement no longer fall within that announcement's operative exemption.","name":"effective_notice_displaces_exemption","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for subsequent notices affecting the assessed tuple and date"}],"result":"(and non_centrally_cleared (or single_stock_option equity_basket_option equity_index_option) (>= assessment_date (date 2026-01-04)) (not effective_notice_displaces_exemption))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_corporation schedule_10_margin_requirement)"},"local_id":"sfc_equity_options_temporal_eligibility","questions":["Is the assessed corporation a licensed corporation, and is the identified requirement within Part III of Schedule 10?","What are the contract's product classification and central-clearing status on the assessment date?","Has any subsequent SFC notice taken effect that withdraws, replaces or limits this exemption for the assessed contract and corporation?","What do the omitted Schedule 10 provisions and unavailable dependencies say about classifications, coverage and transitional treatment?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within the declared scope, true means that the assessed contract satisfies the announced SFC exemption's product, clearing and temporal conditions on the assessment date. False means that at least one of those conditions fails; it does not establish a margin obligation, a breach or ineligibility under another exemption. Unknown facts remain unknown. The result is a proposed eligibility interpretation, not legal approval.","subject":"Date-specific applicability of the announced SFC equity-options margin exemption"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.298564cf01d1366a4a8e2db5","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"10fdfbdb945b999f4760919b1e04643edd9b7a7a6735bf748ae1a89a348836bf","candidate_id":"candidate.4070e2502154461e8f977acad7541648","commitment":"6eedea4e7cbdfae09f6ede8d76922e59da4a27ba445c9c379c0754044062dbcf","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.6eedea4e7cbdfae09f6ede8d","order":6,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["Assessment concerns one corporation, one option contract and one identified margin requirement on a specified date.","Licensed-corporation status is required within this selected scope; registration alone is not treated as licensed-corporation status.","The commencement date concerns exemption treatment on the assessment date, rather than imposing a contract-execution cutoff.","The statement about currently insignificant exposures explains the SFC's decision and does not impose a corporation-specific exposure threshold.","Pending gazettal is not an additional commencement condition, and overseas conditions are not incorporated into SFC eligibility.","Subsequent notices are evaluated for their effective consequences for the assessed contract, corporation and requirement."],"citations":[{"quote":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"The margin requirements for non-centrally cleared equity options were originally scheduled to take effect on that date.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"quote":"However, to prevent regulatory arbitrage and considering that licensed corporations’ exposures to non-centrally cleared equity options are currently insignificant, the SFC has decided to align the exemptions of its margin requirements with the approaches in the European Union (EU) and the UK:","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"1 As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"}],"distinction":"The first prior model conflates transaction execution and assessment time, potentially excluding a pre-2026 contract assessed after commencement. This proposal adopts the second prior model's assessment-date approach, supported by the statement that margin requirements were scheduled to take effect on that date. It also separates the industry-exposure rationale from individual eligibility: the source supplies no individual exposure threshold. Review of both prior models reveals no supported additional counterparty condition or portfolio-wide quantifier.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed corporation holds SFC licensed-corporation status on the assessment date; registration alone does not make this fact true.","name":"licensed_corporation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the corporation on the assessment date"},{"meaning":"The identified requirement is a margin requirement set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct.","name":"specified_margin_requirement","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the identified requirement"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is a single-stock option.","name":"single_stock_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the contract"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is an equity basket option.","name":"equity_basket_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the contract"},{"meaning":"The assessed contract is an equity index option.","name":"equity_index_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the contract"},{"meaning":"The assessed option contract is not centrally cleared on the assessment date.","name":"non_centrally_cleared","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for the contract on the assessment date"},{"meaning":"The date for which margin-exemption treatment is assessed, independently of the date the contract was executed.","name":"assessment_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"At least one subsequent SFC notice has an effective withdrawal, replacement or limitation by the assessment date that removes the assessed corporation, contract and requirement from this announced exemption.","name":"effective_notice_removes_coverage","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value for effective subsequent notices affecting the assessed tuple"}],"result":"(and (or single_stock_option equity_basket_option equity_index_option) non_centrally_cleared (>= assessment_date (date 2026-01-04)) (not effective_notice_removes_coverage))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_corporation specified_margin_requirement)"},"local_id":"assessment_time_and_exposure_rationale","questions":["What are the corporation's licensing status, the contract's option category and clearing status, and the identified margin requirement?","For what date is exemption treatment being assessed?","Has a subsequent SFC notice effectively changed this exemption for the assessed corporation, contract and requirement?","Do the unavailable Schedule 10 provisions or subsequent amendments prescribe transitional treatment affecting existing contracts?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within the declared scope, the result answers whether the option satisfies this announcement's product, clearing and temporal conditions for margin-exemption treatment on the assessment date. True means all those conditions hold; false means at least one fails. False does not establish a margin obligation or breach. Unknown facts remain unknown, and the proposed interpretation confers no legal approval.","subject":"Assessment-date exemption treatment, including contracts executed before commencement"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.6eedea4e7cbdfae09f6ede8d","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[],"rounds":0,"roundtrips":[],"run_id":"run.8048cadf990c427ca55ab4ee74e52824","stop":null}